{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "038daf34-449b-8b59-b23d-49f1fa9c7372",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:37:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:35:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Um, I am calling about the, the plow. For my mother. She is on, um, Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the address on Gidley?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One ninety-six. One nine six Gidley Street. [pause] In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One ninety-six Gidley, got it. And what's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow came, yes, but it, um, it pushed all the snow, the heavy snow, at the end of her driveway. A wall. She cannot get the car out. And now it is rain, so it is, how you say, like cement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens, that slushy stuff gets heavy fast. So you want a plow to come back through and clear it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please. Can a plow come back? [line breaks up] ...the street also, a little bit more wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. Said the street a little more what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wide. The street, it is narrow now, with the snow on the side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm putting that down.196 Gidley, driveway blocked by plow bank, street narrow, request a return pass. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one thing. The parking ban. When does it lift? I am not sure if she must move the car, or, um, if she can leave it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull that up. [pause] Okay, with the storm wrapping up today, the ban is lifted once the plowing's done and they announce it. That's usually tonight or tomorrow morning. Check the city website or the alert line after supper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tonight, maybe. Oh. I thought it would be, um, two days, three days. A long wait. I am glad I was wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, with rain washing it down it clears faster than a straight snowstorm. Now, do you want me to put a callback number on this, in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one eight two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-two. Got it. Liam, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Liam. Lynch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Liam, it's in the queue. They'll get to her as they work through the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
